  "details": "Description\n\nTyping issues sometimes occur when opening chat bubbles and pressing the keyboard fails to input text properly, which also prevents interaction with any in-game content, requiring a restart to resolve\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nThis problem can be solved by restarting the game, but it is not convenient. It is recommended to restart the previous chat bubble. This problem may occur as long as you enter another map and use the chat bubble, which can cause issues including but not limited to inability to type on the chat bubble, inability to use any content in the game, and inability to interact with any content\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 其他\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-03_19-21-27.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_17b77a9c-d4b4-4cac-91e2-e46514d62705/1/file)",
